  "description": "The Energie Carbon is our high performance full carbon cyclocross race bike\n\nDesigned specifically to meet the demands of all-out CX assaults and help you achieve your best come race day. Our full carbon High-Modulus T700 frame features increased stiffness and mud clearance making this a competitive CX race bike.\n\nThe Energie CRX comes equipped with a race ready single ring set up built around the SRAM Force 1 HRD groupset which combines a race ratio cassette(11-32t) with a single ring X-SYNC 40t chainring and Force hydraulic disc brakes. This race machine is completed with tubeless-ready Prime Pro Alloy Disc wheelset paired with Vee XCX TLR tyres and Zipp Servie Course finishing kit.\n\nThe Energie CRX frameset features a High-Modulus T700 HM-UD Carbon construction for superior strength to weight. Full internal cable routing has been specifically designed to prevent ingress of mud and water and to increase comfort when shouldering the bike during racing",
